    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      161.85,
      298.97,
      401.75,
      322.31
    ],
    "text": "1.This Act may be cited as the Prescription (SpecialProvisions) (Amendment) Act, No. of 2018.",
    "fonts": [
      "Times",
      "TimesNewRoman,Bold"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      161.85,
      334.97,
      401.87,
      358.31
    ],
    "text": "2.Section 4 of the Prescription (Special Provisions) Act,No. 5 of 2016 is hereby amended as follows:\u2014",
    "fonts": [
      "Times",
      "TimesNewRoman,Bold"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      177.57,
      370.97,
      401.88,
      418.31
    ],
    "text": "(1)by the substitution for the words \u201ctwo years afterthe coming into operation of this Act.\u201d of the words\u201cfour years from the date of coming into operationof this Act.\u201d;",
    "fonts": [
      "Times"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      177.57,
      430.97,
      401.9,
      478.31
    ],
    "text": "(2)by the substitution for the words \u201ctwo years afterthe date of operation of this Act.\u201d, in the marginalnote to that section, of the words \u201cfour years fromthe date of coming into operation of this Act.\u201d.",
    "fonts": [
      "Times"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      161.85,
      490.97,
      401.9,
      514.31
    ],
    "text": "3.In the event of any inconsistency between the Sinhalaand Tamil texts of this Act, the Sinhala text shall prevail.",
